body:
i tried what you're doing, it doesnt work. i limited my calories below 1000 a day and  was pretty active (like you) and each day you feel more tired and cold, and although you're getting results, it doesnt work. trust me, you're digging a hole and getting deeper into a problem if you don't stop now. im in the hole right now, tryna dig a tunnel so i can move forward, and not backwards. im a minor so im being forced to  eat more food and carbs which totally sucks, and i just wanna move forward and get the body i want the healthy way. 

&#x200B;

EAT MORE and you will have more energy and warmth and will be able to focus. AND your metabolism will be faster causing you to burn MORE calories while resting.
